# Prettier formats the source and configuration this project writes. It does
# not format prose.
#
# Markdown. The design corpus (docs/, 00-13), the execution plan (plan/) and
# README.md are hand-authored living documents whose formatting is deliberate:
# hairline table separators, `*emphasis*`, and lines wrapped by meaning rather
# than by column. Prettier's Markdown printer rewrites all three. They are also
# outside the build by construction - docs/13 §1.2 draws the build-visible tree
# and deliberately omits docs/ and plan/, and nothing in CI reads them.
*.md

# Recorded API responses replayed byte-for-byte by the contract tests
